  "description": "<div><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>&bull; Brand introduction:&nbsp;</strong></span>\r\n<div data-en-clipboard=\"true\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">\r\n<div data-en-clipboard=\"true\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">\r\n<div data-en-clipboard=\"true\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Lola My Love is a California-based online store that offers authentic handmade Mexican Rebozos, baby carriers, handbags, and clothing, all handmade by local artisans in Mexico. </span></div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">We are a mission-driven organization that exclusively works with skilled local artisans from various regions across Mexico. Each piece is meticulously handcrafted with love, care, and attention to detail that shines through in every stitch. By supporting fair trade and ethical practices, we not only provide you with unique, high-quality clothing and rebozos and clothing but also empower these talented artisans and their communities to thrive.&nbsp;</span></div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">We are thrilled to have successfully delivered our beautiful, handmade treasures to over 150 countries worldwide. With reliable and professional shipping services, you can confidently order your favorite pieces from Lola My Love, knowing they'll arrive safely at your doorstep, ready to wrap you and your baby in love and tradition.</span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<br><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">&bull; Product Description:&nbsp;</span></strong></span>\r\n<div data-en-clipboard=\"true\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">\r\n<div data-en-clipboard=\"true\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">The Rebozo is a beautiful traditional Mexican garment designed to support and nurture the mother-baby bond. Made with love and ancient wisdom, this versatile, colorful fabric is perfect for pregnancy, childbirth, and beyond.</span></div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">During pregnancy, our Rebozo cradles your growing belly, fostering a special connection with your unborn baby. As you prepare for labor, it provides comfort by easing contractions and promoting optimal fetal positioning for a serene birth experience.</span></div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Once your little one arrives, transform the Rebozo into a cozy baby carrier, keeping them close and warm, while encouraging essential bonding and healthy development. Experience the countless benefits and timeless tradition of the Rebozo, the ultimate companion for motherhood.</span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div data-en-clipboard=\"true\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">\r\n<div data-en-clipboard=\"true\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><br><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):&nbsp;</strong></span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">We are the world's largest Rebozo store. We are a mission-driven organization that promotes fair trade and ethical practices, empowering artisans and their communities. Our high-quality, unique items have been shipped to over 150 countries with reliable and professional services, ensuring safe and timely deliveries. With Lola My Love, we aim to share this cherished tradition with all of you beautiful expectant mothers. Our rebozos help you bond with your unborn baby, provide comfort during childbirth, and allow you to nurture your little one with that same warmth and closeness in their early days.</span><br><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></div>\r\n<div><br><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>&bull; Payment terms:</strong></span> Weekly payments</span></div>\r\n<div><br><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>&bull; Other information:</strong></span> </span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">💰 Earn 20% commission</span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">💰 We will provide you a 15% OFF coupon code <span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\">to share with your customers for exclusive savings of 15% on their purchases!&nbsp;</span></span></div>",
